          </p>

          <p>
            We work out cost per 25 g of protein the same way on every page: the price, divided by the number of servings times the grams of protein per serving, then multiplied by 25. Servings and protein come from the brand's label. It is the only fair comparison when one scoop gives 24 g and another gives 25 g, or when tubs are different sizes.
          </p>

